# Knowledge base updates

When changing plan prescription, adaptation, safety rules, or user-facing plan notices:

- Update `docs/methodology.md` in the **same PR** (rules, invariants, notice coalescing).
- Update `CLAUDE.md` if edit-target tables or recipes change.
- Add/adjust tests in `packages/engine/src/generate.test.ts`.

Do not merge planning-behavior changes with outdated methodology docs. Prefer fixing the doc over leaving “TODO: document later”.
